      "instance_name": "baby",
      "label": "human infant",
      "description": "A young human infant with light skin and sparse blond hair, captured mid-cry with an expressive, distressed facial expression. The baby's eyes are squeezed shut, eyebrows furrowed, and mouth wide open in a wailing motion, conveying intense emotion. The infant is shirtless and positioned against a plain, neutral gray background, making the emotional expression the central visual focus.",
