      "instance_name": "distress",
      "label": "the distressed emotion",
      "description": "The baby's facial expression — with eyes squeezed shut, furrowed brows, and mouth wide open in a wailing motion — conveys intense emotional distress, frustration, or anguish. This is the primary emotion visually expressed in the image.",
