      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the crying baby as an analogy for admin frustration",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the crying baby visual, interpreting the baby's distress as a humorous representation of their own or others' emotional state when dealing with online group management challenges. The text 'admins be like' and 'this my group' frames the baby's expression as a relatable, exaggerated reaction to group dynamics, inviting the user to identify with the admin's perspective.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
