      "label": "administrators",
      "description": "The meme is designed for individuals who hold or have held administrative roles in online communities, forums, or organizations. These individuals are the primary target audience as the humor is based on their relatable experiences of frustration and exasperation when managing unruly or unreasonable group members. The meme resonates with them by exaggerating their emotional state using the crying baby as an analogy, which is a common trope in internet humor.",
